Subliminal messaging via visual stimuli has been practised for some time. In 1957, there were reports that drinks promotions flashed on a movie screen for a fraction of a second could increase sales by over 50% by striking viewer at a subconscious level. 
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 \hich\f31506 Such techniques were later judged by a United Nations study to be \'93\loch\f31506 \hich\f31506 a major threat to human rights\'94\loch\f31506  and were banned in a number of countries.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
